摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Official Querit integrations for AI agents: real-time, cited web search and page fetch for Pi, DSH, OpenCode, Claude Code, n8n, Zapier, and Browserbase.","id":"gh:1334883986","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"querit-plugins","slug":"querit-ai/querit-plugins","topics":["agent-harness","ai","ai-agents","browserbase","claude-code","deepseek","dsh-plugin","github-copilot","llm","n8n","opencode-plugin","pi-extension","pi-package","plugins","querit","search-api","web-fetch","web-research","web-search","zapier"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Official Querit integrations for AI agents: real-time, cited web search and page fetch for Pi, DSH, "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"OpenCode, Claude Code, n8n, Zapier, and Browserbase."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# querit-plugins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Official Querit search integrations for automation and AI agent platforms."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Querit delivers real-time, authoritative web search results and clean page content for LLM applicati"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ons. Each integration in this repository connects one platform to the Querit API (`/v1/search` + `/v"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"1/contents`) for live web search and page fetching — with cited sources, domain/region/language/time"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"-range filters, and output that is always treated as untrusted web data. The Oh My Pi entry below do"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"cuments an upstream built-in provider, not a package in this repository."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Platform | Package | Install |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Pi | `pi-querit` | `pi install npm:pi-querit` |\n| DeepSeek Harness | `dsh-querit` | `dsh plugin --"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"profile web add dsh-querit` |\n| OpenCode | `opencode-querit` | `\"plugins\": [\"opencode-querit\"]` |\n| "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"Claude Code | `claude-code-querit` | `/plugin marketplace add querit-ai/querit-plugins` |\n| n8n | `n"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"8n-nodes-querit` | Install as an n8n community node |\n| Oh My Pi (OMP) | Built-in Querit provider (n"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ot a plugin) | No install; available after upstream PR merges |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Two more integrations live in this repository but are not generally available yet:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Platform | Directory | Status |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Zapier | `zapier-querit/` | Complete and locally validated; awaiting registration and Zapier publi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"c review |\n| Browserbase | `browserbase-querit-demo/` | Reference demo, not a published package |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"How each package integration reads the API key and search defaults is covered in its own section bel"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ow; the Oh My Pi section documents its upstream built-in provider. Recent updates are summarized in "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"My Pi section documents its upstream built-in provider. Recent updates are summarized in CHANGES.md."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Get an API key"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Sign up on Querit.ai to get an API key with **1,000 free API calls per month** — no credit card requ"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ired. The same key works for all integrations."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## pi-querit — Pi"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"A Pi extension that registers `web_search` and `fetch_content` as first-class tools. Your agent call"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"s them automatically whenever an answer needs the live web."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Install**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**API key**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Run the interactive setup wizard inside Pi once:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The wizard validates the key, then lets you configure persistent search defaults (result count, time"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" range, countries, languages, domain whitelist/blacklist) and an optional fixed-model auto-summary w"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"orkflow. Everything except the API key can be skipped."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Where the key lives:** `~/.pi/agent/querit-search.json` (respects `PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR`), writte"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"n with mode `0600` on POSIX.\n- **CI / ephemeral alternative:** set the `QUERIT_API_KEY` environment "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"variable. The environment variable takes precedence when both are present.\n- **Never put the key in "},{"id":"p21s4","text":"chat or logs:** the extension masks key input and redacts the key from every error surface."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"See the pi-querit README for the full tool reference."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## dsh-querit — DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"A provider package for the DeepSeek Harness `ctx.web` capability seam. It does not register the mode"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"l-facing `web_search` tool; the agent preset does. By default, it reuses the official `applyWebFetch"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"Tool` helper to register `web_fetch`, and routes both tools through Querit-backed providers."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**Install**"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Requires dsh 0.1.2+ — v1.1.2 keeps the 0.1.2 host seams (`ctx.settings` service, `remote.credentials"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"` client namespace) and widens the peer range so 0.1.5-rc / 0.1.6-alpha hosts satisfy npm. On older "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"dsh hosts pin `dsh-querit@1.0.6`."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Then wire it in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"**API key** — resolved per operation in priority order:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"1. `QUERIT_API_KEY` exported in the launching environment, or\n2. the credentials store `$DSH_HOME/.c"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"redentials.yaml` (`QUERIT_API_KEY: <key>`, hot-reloaded), or\n3. a literal `apiKey` on the `web-searc"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"h-querit` row (least preferred — secrets should not live in composition files)."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Search defaults (`count`, `timeRange`, `countries`, `languages`, `includeDomains`, `excludeDomains`,"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" `includeContent`, `chunksPerDoc`, fetch format/timeouts) are configured on the plugin row or in the"},{"id":"p32s3","text":" hot-reloaded `$DSH_HOME/settings.yaml` `web-search-querit:` section."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"See the dsh-querit README for the full config table."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## opencode-querit — OpenCode"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"An OpenCode v2 plugin (opencode ≥ 2.0.3) that registers **Querit as a websearch provider** — powerin"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"g the built-in `websearch` tool, no `OPENCODE_ENABLE_EXA`/`OPENCODE_ENABLE_PARALLEL` flags needed — "},{"id":"p35s3","text":"plus a `web_fetch` custom tool backed by Querit's crawler. On opencode v1 pin `opencode-querit@1.0.2"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"us a `web_fetch` custom tool backed by Querit's crawler. On opencode v1 pin `opencode-querit@1.0.2`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"**Install**"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Add the plugin to `opencode.json`:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Then restart OpenCode. On the first `websearch` call pick Querit in OpenCode's provider form, or pin"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" it once with `\"websearch\": { \"provider\": \"querit\" }`."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**API key** — resolved per call in priority order:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"1. `QUERIT_API_KEY` environment variable (default; rename via `apiKeyEnv`), or\n2. `apiKey` in the pl"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"ugin options (least preferred — secrets should not live in config files):"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Search defaults and fetch behavior are configured the same way (`count`, `timeRange`, `countries`, `"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"languages`, `includeDomains`, `excludeDomains`, `includeContent`, `chunksPerDoc`, `fetchFormat`, `fe"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"tchCrawlTimeout`, `fetchMaxChars`, `maxOutputChars`)."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"See the opencode-querit README for the full config table and local-testing instructions."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## claude-code-querit — Claude Code"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"A Claude Code plugin that bundles a stdio MCP server exposing `web_search` and `fetch_content`, plus"},{"id":"p46s2","text":" a `/querit-ai:research` skill for source-grounded answers with citations."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"**Install**"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"**API key** — the plugin reads only the `QUERIT_API_KEY` environment variable, which the MCP server "},{"id":"p49s2","text":"process inherits from the environment that launches Claude Code. There is deliberately no in-product"},{"id":"p49s3","text":" key option: one variable covers local development, CI, and UI installs."},{"id":"p50s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
